.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-host 1  "quarters-host " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-host \- Run a command with host user\-state paths from a baseline space
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-host\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICOMMAND\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a command with host user\-state paths from a baseline space
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICOMMAND\fR>
Command and arguments. Put `\-\-` before options meant for the command
